  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Chat path",
      "items": [
        "The SPA POSTs /chat/stream and reads meta, status, citations, tokens, error, and done",
        "Smalltalk stays direct; research uses docs and the web; otherwise RAG runs when the user has docs",
        "Web runs only for a fresh query while the toggle is on and Tavily has a key",
        "An in-memory semantic cache can skip generation; web, follow-ups, and regenerates bypass it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Local data",
      "items": [
        "Default database is data/chatbot.db: sessions, messages, and document rows",
        "Chunk text and FTS5 live in data/index/rag.sqlite3; vectors are per-user FAISS files",
        "Embeddings default to local BAAI/bge-small ONNX; Google or Cohere only if configured",
        "If the document row fails after indexing, those chunks are deleted"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Failures",
      "items": [
        "Chat routes return 429 over the per-user limit and 503 when no LLM key is set",
        "Models fail over before the first token; a mid-stream error can still save a partial answer",
        "A retrieval or Tavily failure is logged and generation continues without that context",
        "SQLAlchemy rolls back its unit of work; chunk inserts commit or roll back together"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Other doors",
      "items": [
        "MCP also calls retrieval.search, documents.list_documents, and search.search on the same container",
        "Startup warm-up is one asyncio task: embeddings, reranker, model discovery, OCR, then reindex",
        "URL upload fetches HTML behind an SSRF check; there is no login and user_id defaults to default",
        "/sessions, /retrieve, /search, and /generate call these services without the chat router"
      ]
    }
  ]
